    note_tile:
      html_parsed_string: |-
        Key Drivers:
        • West region leads with $725K sales, 85% higher than lowest performer
        • East region strong at $679K, only 7% behind West
        • South region underperforms at $392K, representing 54% of West's volume
        • $333K gap exists between top (West) and bottom (South) performing regions

        Recommendations:
        • Focus growth initiatives on South region to close $333K performance gap
        • Analyze West region best practices for replication in underperforming areas
        • Investigate Central region opportunities to bridge toward East/West performance levels
